; constants: values of X_DEPLOY_STATE: X_STATE_NONE (0) where there is no part; X_STATE_BROKEN is never produced in this game build
.equ X_STATE_NONE, 0
.equ X_STATE_DEPLOYED, 1
.equ X_STATE_RETRACTED, 2
.equ X_STATE_DEPLOYING, 3
.equ X_STATE_RETRACTING, 4
.equ X_STATE_BROKEN, 5

